MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Arena_m03: <TH>
MID_LGA_1_Dagsion_Arena_m03: <BLN>Revenez aux horaires d'ouverture.
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Stable01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGA_1_Dagsion_Stable01_m01: <BLN>Je vais m'occuper de vos montures.
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_VandalCompany01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGA_1_Dagsion_VandalCompany01_m01: <BLN>Consortium Vandahl, bonjour !
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Bar01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGA_1_Dagsion_Bar01_m01: <BLN>Je vous sers quelque chose ?
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Bar01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGA_1_Dagsion_Bar01_m02: <BLN>Envie de goûter une nouveauté ?
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Hotel02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGA_1_Dagsion_Hotel02_m01: <BLN>Nos lits sont les plus confortables.
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_TempleAurora01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGA_1_Dagsion_TempleAurora01_m01: <BLN>Bienvenue au temple d'Aurora.
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_TempleJura01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGA_1_Dagsion_TempleJura01_m01: <BLN>Vous entrez au temple de Jurah.
