MID_LGA_1_Dagsion_TempleSmyrnos01_m01: <BLN>Vous voilà au temple de Smyrnos.
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_TempleCarla01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGA_1_Dagsion_TempleCarla01_m01: <BLN>Kalla vous souhaite la bienvenue.
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_TempleClaire01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGA_1_Dagsion_TempleClaire01_m01: <BLN>Voici le temple de Credna.
